EG" TYPE="REP"><BIB.DATA><BIB.INSTANCE.CONS><DOCUMENT.REF.CONS><COLL>L</COLL><NO.OJ>144</NO.OJ><YEAR>2006</YEAR><LG.OJ>EN</LG.OJ><PAGE.FIRST>15</PAGE.FIRST><PAGE.SEQ>1</PAGE.SEQ><VOLUME.REF>01</VOLUME.REF></DOCUMENT.REF.CONS><DATE ISO="20060531">20060531</DATE><LG.DOC>EN</LG.DOC><NO.SEQ>0006</NO.SEQ><PAGE.FIRST>15</PAGE.FIRST><PAGE.SEQ>1</PAGE.SEQ><PAGE.LAST>17</PAGE.LAST><PAGE.TOTAL>3</PAGE.TOTAL><NO.DOC FORMAT="NY" TYPE="OJ"><NO.CURRENT>802</NO.CURRENT><YEAR>2006</YEAR><COM>EC</COM></NO.DOC></BIB.INSTANCE.CONS><NO.CELEX>32006R0802</NO.CELEX><DATE ISO="20060530">20060530</DATE><TITLE><TI><P><HT TYPE="UC">Commission Regulation</HT> (EC) No 802/2006</P><P>of <DATE ISO="20060530">30 May 2006</DATE></P><P>fixing the conversion factors applicable to fish of the genera <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Thunnus</HT> and <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Euthynnus</HT></P></TI></TITLE></BIB.DATA></MOD.ACT></GR.MOD.ACT></FAM.COMP><?CLG.MDFO ID="O004001M001000" IDREF="C004001M001000" ACTION="REPEALED" LEVEL="STRUCTURE" COMMAND="EXPLICIT" ACTIVE.DOC="32006R0802" ACTIVE.LOC="AR:2" MOD.LEVEL="1" ?><TITLE><TI><P><HT TYPE="UC">Commission Regulation</HT> (EEC) No 3510/82</P><P>of 23 December 1982</P><P>fixing the conversion factors applicable to <?CLG.MDFO ID="O001001M001002" IDREF="C001001M001002" ACTION="REPLACED" LEVEL="TEXT" COMMAND="EXPLICIT" ACTIVE.DOC="31987R3940" ACTIVE.LOC="AR:1 .AND. AX:0;PT:VII;PT:1" MOD.LEVEL="1"?>fish of the genera <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Thunnus</HT> and <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Euthynnus</HT><?CLG.MDFC ID="C001001M001002" IDREF="O001001M001002"?></P></TI></TITLE><PREAMBLE><PREAMBLE.INIT>THE COMMISSION OF THE EUROPEAN COMMUNITIES,</PREAMBLE.INIT><GR.VISA><VISA>Having regard to the Treaty establishing the European Economic Community,</VISA><VISA>Having regard to Council Regulation (EEC) No 3796/81 of 29 December 1981 on the common organization of the market in fishery products<NOTE NOTE.ID="E0001" NUMBERING="ARAB" TYPE="FOOTNOTE"><P><REF.DOC.OJ COLL="L" DATE.PUB="19810901" NO.OJ="379" PAGE.FIRST="1">OJ No L 379, 31. 12. 1981, p. 1</REF.DOC.OJ>.</P></NOTE>, and in particular Article 17 (6) thereof,</VISA></GR.VISA><GR.CONSID><CONSID><P>Whereas a Community producer price is fixed every year for <?CLG.MDFO ID="O001001M002001" IDREF="C001001M002001" ACTION="REPLACED" LEVEL="TEXT" COMMAND="EXPLICIT" ACTIVE.DOC="31987R3940" ACTIVE.LOC="AR:1 .AND. AX:0;PT:VII;PT:1" MOD.LEVEL="1"?>fish of the genera <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Thunnus</HT> and <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Euthynnus</HT><?CLG.MDFC ID="C001001M002001" IDREF="O001001M002001"?> intended for the canning industry;</P></CONSID><CONSID><P>Whereas the conversion factors applicable to the different species, sizes and presentations of <?CLG.MDFO ID="O001001M002002" IDREF="C001001M002002" ACTION="REPLACED" LEVEL="TEXT" COMMAND="EXPLICIT" ACTIVE.DOC="31987R3940" ACTIVE.LOC="AR:1 .AND. AX:0;PT:VII;PT:1" MOD.LEVEL="1"?>fish of the genera <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Thunnus</HT> and <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Euthynnus</HT><?CLG.MDFC ID="C001001M002002" IDREF="O001001M002002"?> should also be fixed;</P></CONSID><CONSID><P>Whereas the measures provided for in this Regulation are in accordance with the opinion of the Management Committee for Fishery Products,</P></CONSID></GR.CONSID><PREAMBLE.FINAL>HAS ADOPTED THIS REGULATION:</PREAMBLE.FINAL></PREAMBLE><ENACTING.TERMS><ARTICLE IDENTIFIER="001"><TI.ART>Article 1</TI.ART><ALINEA>The conversion factors applicable to the different species, sizes and presentations of <?CLG.MDFO ID="O001001M003000" IDREF="C001001M003000" ACTION="REPLACED" LEVEL="TEXT" COMMAND="EXPLICIT" ACTIVE.DOC="31987R3940" ACTIVE.LOC="AR:1 .AND. AX:0;PT:VII;PT:1" MOD.LEVEL="1"?>fish of the genera <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Thunnus</HT> and <HT TYPE="ITALIC">Euthynnus</HT><?CLG.MDFC ID="C001001M003000" IDREF="O001001M003000"?> shall be as listed in the Annex hereto.</ALINEA></ARTICLE><ARTICLE IDENTIFIER="002"><TI.ART>Article 2</TI.ART><ALINEA>This Regulation shall enter into force on 1 January 1983.</ALINEA></ARTICLE></ENACTING.TERMS><FINAL><P>This Regulation shall be binding in its entirety and directly applicable in all Member States.</P></FINAL><?CLG.MDFO ID="O003001M001000" IDREF="C003001M001000" ACTION="REPLACED" LEVEL="STRUCTURE" COMMAND="EXPLICIT" ACTIVE.DOC="31992R3899" ACTIVE.LOC="AR:1 .AND. AX:0" MOD.LEVEL="1"?><CONS.ANNEX><TITLE><TI><P>ANNEX</P></TI></TITLE><CONTENTS><TBL CLASS="GEN" COLS="2" NO.SEQ="0001"><TITLE><TI><NP><NO.P>I.</NO.P><TXT>Conversion factors applicable to the different species of tuna</TXT></NP></TI></TITLE><CORPUS><ROW TYPE="HEADER"><CELL COL="1" TYPE="HEADER">Species</CELL><CELL COL="2" TYPE="HEADER">Conversion factor</CELL></ROW><BLK><TI.BLK COL.END="1" COL.START="1"><NP><NO.P>A.</NO.P><TXT>Yellowfin tuna <HT TYPE="ITALIC">(Thunnus albacares)</HT>:</TXT></NP></TI.BLK><BLK><ROW><CELL COL="1"><NP><NO.P>—</NO.P><TXT>weighing more than 10 kg each</TXT></NP></CELL><CELL COL="2"><FT TYPE="DECIMAL">1,0</FT></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL COL="1"><NP><NO.P>—</NO.P><TXT>weighing not more than 10 kg each</TXT></NP></CELL><CELL COL="2"><FT TYPE="DECIMAL">0,78</FT></CELL></ROW></BLK></BLK><ROW><CELL COL="1"><GR.SEQ LEVEL="1"><NO.GR.SEQ>B.</NO.GR.SEQ><P>Albacore <HT TYPE="ITALIC">(Thunnus alalunga)</HT></P></GR.SEQ></CELL><CELL COL="2"><FT TYPE="DECIMAL">1,40</FT></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL COL="1"><GR.SEQ LEVEL="1"><NO.GR.SEQ>C.</NO.GR.SEQ><P>Skipjack <HT TYPE="ITALIC">[Euthynnus (Katsuwonus) pelamis]</HT></P></GR.SEQ></CELL><CELL COL="2"><FT TYPE="DECIMAL">0,62</FT></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL COL="1"><GR.SEQ LEVEL="1"><NO.GR.SEQ>D.</NO.GR.SEQ><P>Other species</P></GR.SEQ></CELL><CELL COL="2"><FT TYPE="DECIMAL">0,75</FT></CELL></ROW></CORPUS></TBL><TBL CLASS="GEN" COLS="2" NO.SEQ="0002"><TITLE><TI><NP><NO.P>II.</NO.P><TXT>Conversion factors applicable to each of the species referred to in section I depending on the presentation</TXT></NP></TI></TITLE><CORPUS><ROW TYPE="HEADER"><CELL COL="1" TYPE="HEADER">Presentation</CELL><CELL COL="2" TYPE="HEADER">Conversion factor</CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL COL="1"><GR.SE